Session: Runtime

Purpose:
  Defines runtime session management for orchestrator.

Session:
  ID:
    SESSION-<timestamp>-<random>

  Started:
    <timestamp>

  Ended:
    <timestamp> | null

  Mode:
    AUTO | SUPERVISED | STRICT | AUDIT | READ_ONLY

  Project:
    <project-name>

  User:
    <user-id>

SessionState:
  CurrentTask:
    <task-id>

  CurrentPhase:
    <phase>

  LastStep:
    <last-successful-step>

  NextAction:
    <next-action>

  Status:
    ACTIVE | PAUSED | COMPLETED | FAILED

SessionHistory:
  - SESSION-<ID>:
      Started: <ISO-8601>
      Ended: <ISO-8601>
      Tasks: TASK-<ID>, TASK-<ID>
      Status: COMPLETED

SessionRules:
  [SS1]  Session MUST be persisted on every state change.
  [SS2]  Session MUST be resumable after crash.
  [SS3]  Session history MUST be retained for audit.

State: +
  